      "content": "Look, I know we need to be careful, but the geological report specifically mentions potential soil liquefaction issues in the north sector of the site. If I bring this to the Board now, everything stalls for months or years. Is the liquefaction risk actually a dealbreaker, or is it something that can be managed with standard engineering? We really need to find a way to move this forward.",
